1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
This is AgentLedger.

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:05,632
It audits the JSON log of an AI agent run, entirely in your browser.

3
00:00:05,632 --> 00:00:09,728
Everything in this demo is synthetic sample data, marked SAMPLE.

4
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:12,522
You choose the bar for five controls:

5
00:00:12,522 --> 00:00:17,470
traceability, versioning, hallucination rate, human oversight, and groundedness.

6
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:21,244
Each threshold is editable, and it is saved with every audit.

7
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:23,873
The groundedness check is optional.

8
00:00:23,873 --> 00:00:29,252
It uses your own Anthropic API key, which stays in this tab's memory and is never saved.

9
00:00:29,252 --> 00:00:31,208
In this demo, we leave it empty.

10
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,949
Now, upload a run.

11
00:00:32,949 --> 00:00:38,220
This sample trace has a user question, a tool output, and two model answers.

12
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:41,555
Each control is scored against your thresholds.

13
00:00:41,555 --> 00:00:42,755
Traceability passes:

14
00:00:42,755 --> 00:00:44,016
every step has an ID.

15
00:00:44,016 --> 00:00:45,037
Versioning fails:

16
00:00:45,037 --> 00:00:47,678
only the two answers record a model version.

17
00:00:47,678 --> 00:00:53,501
Hallucination rate and human oversight are not evidenced, because the log has no labels for them.

18
00:00:53,501 --> 00:00:55,902
Missing data is never counted as a pass.

19
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,572
Groundedness is not evidenced either.

20
00:00:58,572 --> 00:01:00,804
No key was given, so no call was made.

21
00:01:00,804 --> 00:01:04,914
The method, the model, and the prompt version are shown on the result.

22
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,586
Every result links to the exact log entry it came from.

23
00:01:08,586 --> 00:01:12,932
Click a step, and you land on the source, with the field each control read.

24
00:01:13,433 --> 00:01:19,993
The report page gives the overall opinion, and exports to Markdown or PDF, generated on this device.

25
00:01:20,667 --> 00:01:23,438
Each audit is also written to a local ledger.

26
00:01:23,438 --> 00:01:27,256
Every record carries the SHA-256 hash of the record before it.

27
00:01:27,256 --> 00:01:32,983
Verify ledger recomputes the whole chain, and names the exact record if anything was changed.

28
00:01:33,467 --> 00:01:34,248
AgentLedger.

29
00:01:34,248 --> 00:01:38,676
Evidence-linked results, never invented, in a tamper-evident ledger.
